TrackMe 1.7.2

• Ride Together statuses: tell your group you've stopped for fuel, hit a vehicle issue, or are taking a break — without typing.

• Every rider's row now shows when the group last heard from them, so you can tell "just now" from "ten minutes ago".

• Open directions to a rider's last known point.

• Your own screen now tells you when the group has stopped receiving your updates.

• More accurate freshness: stale positions no longer look current.
